WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.883
Fictional first use: privacy, terms, language and optional SMS assistance with per-message approval.

2
00:00:07.933 --> 00:00:15.883
Simulated login: approved one-message sharing auto-verifies only SMS-only login; keyboard autofill retains Verify.

3
00:00:15.933 --> 00:00:23.883
Combined question plus SMS retains Verify; device approval and password change remain separate steps.

4
00:00:23.933 --> 00:00:31.883
Offline demo: fictional accounts, DOP/USD, balance privacy and swipe-direction arrows.

5
00:00:31.933 --> 00:00:39.816
Simulated banking history: search and filters; the demo shares a fictional CSV through Android.

6
00:00:39.866 --> 00:00:47.749
Synthetic PDF: pages, zoom, sharing and selected-period saving with a simulated folder.

7
00:00:47.799 --> 00:00:55.682
Demo transfers: local code 123456, not SMS. Simulated bank: review, Android autofill of the SMS code and Verify.

8
00:00:55.732 --> 00:01:03.615
Demo payment with a local code; simulated bank payment with Android autofill of the SMS code and Verify.

9
00:01:03.665 --> 00:01:11.548
Recipient code, local save and simulated bank deletion with SMS code autofill and Verify.

10
00:01:11.598 --> 00:01:19.481
Read-only cards: bank-supplied holder/identifier, full number only if supplied; informational services make no changes.

11
00:01:19.531 --> 00:01:27.481
Simulated Token BSC: contract and unlinking; SMS code autofill then Verify. Generated token codes are not SMS.

12
00:01:27.531 --> 00:01:35.481
Fictional QR request: saving, recipient review and print preview.

13
00:01:35.531 --> 00:01:43.481
SMS assistance off then on; delivery is separate. Bank authorization and owner-account validation remain unresolved.
